    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mahjong Route is a mahjong-themed card roguelike game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated maps, cards, and opponents. Experience different games in different hands over and over again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the right route and experience the unpredictable route!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against opponents with very different styles and achieve a possible victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make flexible decisions to play different cards and explore all kinds of cards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy and use powerful Wan Nian cards to enhance your strength inside and outside the game!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mahjong Route is a mahjong-themed card roguelike game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated maps, cards, and opponents. Experience different games in different hands over and over again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the right route and experience the unpredictable route!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against opponents with very different styles and achieve a possible victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make flexible decisions to play different cards and explore all kinds of cards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy and use powerful Wan Nian cards to enhance your strength inside and outside the game!</p>",
    "short_description": "Mahjong Route is a mahjong-themed card roguelike game. Enter the card hall and play special mahjong games against a variety of opponents, buy powerful and suitable Wan Nian tiles, and don't forget to replenish your blood on the way.",
